--- !u!114 &100596345
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 100596343}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 778b480bb38e4ef491b41adb778f4536, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LWS.TruckCamping.CampHelpPages
  text: {fileID: 1143644017}
  number: {fileID: 1730658651}
  previous: {fileID: 2035378727}
  next: {fileID: 2000240951}
  pages:
  - 'LITTLE FRIENDS. BIG TRUCKS.


    Adopt a miniature truck, fully clothed adult
    character or animated dog in Setup/Pause. Names are editable; pet and owner IDs
    stay stable. Each owner has a separate companion and saved care/trick record.


    Drive
    gently. Your pet follows a soft visual leash and occasionally investigates, sniffs
    or takes a funny grass break. Unclip in a marked play glade; CALL brings it back.
    A held STAY ends with CALL.


    ACTION opens care choices. Feed from your real
    camp supplies, throw a nearby physical toy, nap or select a trick. Sit, lie down,
    roll over, shake, dig, stay and come all perform visible routines. Tap ACTION
    during the gentle cue; actual execution improves familiarity. Dig requires a
    marked soft-soil patch.


    At a wash station: hold ACTION for water/soap/rinse/dry,
    alternate left/right to scrub, then tap ACTION for the next stage. Cleanliness
    changes visibly. Pets remain forgiving and never starve.'
  - 'Pet VIEW follows your companion in chase view; private cab stays yours. PHOTO
    is shared and captures real scenic images. Camping''s actual forest, trails,
    lake, wildlife and camp activities are reused.


    No points or winner. Companion
    profiles autosave through the existing mode-local Pixel Crushers storer; Pause
    SAVE also preserves the strict expedition/terrain/pose snapshot. Finish care
    interactions before saving a workshop.'
--- !u!114 &100596346
