  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'LITTLE FRIENDS. BIG TRUCKS.


    Adopt a miniature truck, fully clothed
    adult character or animated dog in Setup/Pause. Names are editable; pet and owner
    IDs stay stable. Each owner has a separate companion and saved care/trick record.


    Drive
    gently. Your pet follows a soft visual leash and occasionally investigates, sniffs
    or takes a funny grass break. Unclip in a marked play glade; CALL brings it back.
    A held STAY ends with CALL.


    ACTION opens care choices. Feed from your real
    camp supplies, throw a nearby physical toy, nap or select a trick. Sit, lie down,
    roll over, shake, dig, stay and come all perform visible routines. Tap ACTION
    during the gentle cue; actual execution improves familiarity. Dig requires a
    marked soft-soil patch.


    At a wash station: hold ACTION for water/soap/rinse/dry,
    alternate left/right to scrub, then tap ACTION for the next stage. Cleanliness
    changes visibly. Pets remain forgiving and never starve.


    Pet VIEW follows
    your companion in chase view; private cab stays yours. PHOTO is shared and captures
    real scenic images. Camping''s actual forest, trails, lake, wildlife and camp
    activities are reused.


    No points or winner. Companion profiles autosave
    through the existing mode-local Pixel Crushers storer; Pause SAVE also preserves
    the strict expedition/terrain/pose snapshot. Finish care interactions before
    saving a workshop.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
